<title>NORWAY: Hafslund 1996 net profits up slightly.</title>
<headline>Hafslund 1996 net profits up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating income	     1,504	 vs     1,298</p>
<p> Operating result		 274	 vs	 265</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		   327	 vs	 341</p>
<p> After-tax profit		 255	 vs	 242</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian power producer is Hafslund ASA. A Reuter poll of eight analysts forecast an operating result of 254 million crowns and pre-tax profits of 310 million crowns. Two of the analysts recommended to buy the share, three said hold, one said sell and two declined to provide a recommendation.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
